OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CPSNI repeats apology to Pat Finucane's 
OL,5,Cfamily during inquiry                  
OL,6,GThe Police Service of Northern Ireland 
OL,7,G(PSNI) has repeated an apology over    
OL,8,Gthe murder of Pat Finucane, describing 
OL,9,Git as an act of "brutality" without    
OL,10,Gjustification.                         
OL,12,FIt was read out as part of an opening  
OL,13,Fsubmission by a lawyer for the PSNI at 
OL,14,Fthe inquiry into the solicitor's       
OL,15,Fkilling.                               
OL,17,FThe inquiry was also told the          
OL,18,Fgovernment intends as much evidence    
OL,19,F"as possible" to be heard in public.   
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
