OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CSmell leads police to discover         
OL,5,C'substantial' cannabis factory         
OL,6,GPolice in Portadown have uncovered a   
OL,7,G"substantial" cannabis factory after   
OL,8,Gnoting a strong smell of the drug in   
OL,9,Gthe area.                              
OL,11,FTwo men were arrested following the    
OL,12,Fdiscovery of the premises in the       
OL,13,FAnnagh Hill industrial estate on       
OL,14,FWednesday morning.                     
OL,16,FUpon investigation, police discovered  
OL,17,Fan operation spanning three floors and 
OL,18,Fcontaining plants with an estimated    
OL,19,Fstreet value of #200,000.              
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
