OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CJapanese technology company to create  
OL,5,C200 new jobs                           
OL,6,GOne of Japan's largest technology      
OL,7,Gcompanies is creating around 200 jobs  
OL,8,Gin a new Artificial Intelligence (AI)  
OL,9,Gcentre in Londonderry.                 
OL,11,FNTT DATA announced on Wednesday that   
OL,12,Fit was investing more than #23m to set 
OL,13,Fup a new AI centre of excellence in    
OL,14,FDerry.                                 
OL,16,FThe company, which describes itself as 
OL,17,Fa global leader in AI, digital         
OL,18,Fbusiness and technology services, will 
OL,19,Frecruit 200 people on an average       
OL,20,Fannual salary of #58k to work there    
OL,21,Fover the next three years.             
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
